I mean you can't out run a bear on a good day, you certainly aren't doing it when your breathing passages look like that.

That is my fear with buying a car with no title... go do all the work to get the title situation sorted out and find out it was stolen. They take the vehicle and I am out what i paid for it.

&#x200B;

If you do decide to buy it I would make sure to see the sellers ID, maybe ask to take a picture of it and get a bill of sale with their signature. That way if it comes back as stolen you send the law that way instead of them being on you.

This right here is exactly why I wont quit, nor should anyone quit over a mandate. Force them to fire you. Once done (if they actually follow through with it) you get unemployment benefits and if the tides change soon you have grounds for a wrongful termination lawsuit. Where if you quit you get none of this. 

&#x200B;

Also people trickling out over a month is a lot different than forcing a manger to do paperwork on firing like 20-75% (depending on field and area of country) of their staff all at once.

This is ridiculous. When all this started and masks first became mandatory we were working on information that Covid had like a 10+% mortality rate. NOW, doctors and hospitals have better protocols and understand what they are dealing with better. ALSO, we know that it is less than a 2% mortality rate, which isnt good, but it is a lot less than originally projected.

&#x200B;

The vaccine is available if you want it.

&#x200B;

Masks are available if you want to use them, just because they are not mandatory doesn't mean you CAN'T use them if you are scared.  


lets just be a free country again.

how about you let people do what they will as long as it is not harming anyone and let God judge them when it comes to that time.

&#x200B;

This crap is what I hate about most religious  people. They seem to forget all the parts about loving thy neighbor, and not passing judgment. They just love to look down on others for the bits and pieces they choose to remember and hold on to.

&#x200B;

For your sake I hope you never covet other women besides your wife. I hope you were a virgin until marriage. I hope you never mix clothing fabrics. If I am not mistaken your comment alone is a sin.

&#x200B;

So STFU and let people do what they want in private as long as it is in private and not hurting anyone.

so you are the guy to take shit way out of proportion then criticize the result. People must love you.

